CONTAINER SECURITY & DEVSECOPS

These scenarios are based on real vulnerabilities, compliance issues, and production security incidents.

⸻

🛡️ Container Security & DevSecOps – Real-World Scenarios
	1.	A container image has critical vulnerabilities. What steps do you take before deploying it?
	2.	How do you prevent developers from using latest or untrusted images?
	3.	Secrets are baked into a Docker image. How do you fix this securely?
	4.	A container is running as root. Why is this risky and how do you fix it?
	5.	How do you scan container images automatically in CI/CD pipelines?
	6.	How do you manage image signing and trust?
	7.	A Kubernetes pod was compromised. How do you investigate and respond?
	8.	How do you implement runtime security for containers?
	9.	How do you restrict container-to-container communication?
	10.	How do you enforce security policies across all clusters?
	11.	How do you handle security exceptions without slowing delivery?
	12.	How do you audit who deployed what and when?
	13.	A security scan fails in production. Do you block deployment?
	14.	How do you secure container registries?
	15.	How do you educate teams on container security best practices?

